# Local visual-review utility for generated REALM_DROID100 renders; not part of the release.
tooling/droid100_frame_browser/

# Apptainer/Singularity images -- 9-13 GB each, built from .docker/*.def
*.sif
# Thumbnail caches written by USD tooling
.thumbs/

# Session scratch (logs, probe scripts, extracted frames)
tmp/
# run_suite.py's default --out lands in the cwd when invoked without make (make routes it to tmp/)
suite_results.json

# Personal runtime environments remain local. The committed pyproject.toml / uv.lock describe
# host-only lint and static-test tools; REALM itself still runs from Docker / Apptainer via
# PYTHONPATH and is not installed into that uv environment.
environment.yml
Makefile
wiki/Known-Issues.md

# Robot assets awaiting proper integration (owner decision 2026-08-18: keep local, do not commit).
# r1lite has no config/definition yet; the live WidowX path uses OmniGibson's stock VX300S, not
# these files. When one is wired up (definitions/ entry + config), remove its line here and add
# the assets deliberately.
realm/robots/r1lite/
realm/robots/widowx/

# Staged OG-lite package for image builds (scripts/stage_oglite_for_build.sh). A copy of a
# separate repo -- never committed; regenerate it before building.
.docker/vendor/
